<h1 id="a000062">Tapado (Sea Food Soup)</h1>

<p><a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/theroadislife/73849729/" title="Photo Sharing"><img src="http://static.flickr.com/20/73849729_b5320ad07a.jpg" width="480" height="360" alt="Tapado Soup" /></a></p>

